Package: kalinka-plugin-bluetooth
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: kalinka-server, kalinka-plugin-sdk (>= 3.23), kalinka-plugin-sdk (<< 4), python3 (>= 3.11), bluez, bluez-alsa-utils (>= 4.3.1)
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Description: Bluetooth audio input for Kalinka
 Receives A2DP audio with BlueALSA and routes live PCM to the selected
 local or remote Kalinka renderer, without transport compression.
